# .NET build artefacts (recursive across all projects)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/TestResults/

# IDE / editor state
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# Repo metadata not needed at build time
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.claude/

# Heavy generated artefacts — the Fly image rebuilds the Angular SPA from source,
# so node_modules / caches / prior dist are excluded (but the source is NOT, unlike
# the dev API image). Keeps the build context small and never ships local secrets.
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/dist/
.env

# Compose / docker artefacts that should not be copied into images
docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore

# Misc
*.log
*.pid
*.swp
README*.md
LICENSE*
